# Copy to `.env`; every value is optional. Browser-visible `VITE_` values are public.

# Adds "Email (Privy)" to the EVM wallet list. Free app at dashboard.privy.io: enable Email login and
# Ethereum embedded wallets, and allow the origin http://localhost:3002. Unset, the build has no Privy code.
# VITE_PRIVY_APP_ID=
